    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Level 9 Bastion Facility</em></p><p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> None<br /><strong>Space:</strong> Vast<br /><strong>Hirelings:</strong> 4<br /><strong>Order:</strong> Trade</p><p>A hall for recreation: chess, darts, cards, or dice.</p><p><strong>Trade: Gambling Hall.</strong> The hirelings turn the hall into a gambling den for 7 days. At the end of the seventh day, roll 1d100 to determine your share of the house winnings.</p><table><thead><tr><th>1d100</th><th>Winnings</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>01–50</td><td>1d6 × 10 GP</td></tr><tr><td>51–85</td><td>2d6 × 10 GP</td></tr><tr><td>86–95</td><td>4d6 × 10 GP</td></tr><tr><td>96–00</td><td>10d6 × 10 GP</td></tr></tbody></table>",
